1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,333
StudyHub: a calm place for your courses, tasks, timetable and notes.

2
00:00:06,733 --> 00:00:15,233
Start by creating an account
Your data is private. Nobody else can see it

3
00:00:15,933 --> 00:00:24,433
From the faculty? Enter the faculty code
It is shared in your class group and unlocks the archive and your level’s tasks

4
00:00:25,867 --> 00:00:31,100
This is your overview
Your day at a glance: lectures, tasks and upcoming deadlines

5
00:00:31,200 --> 00:00:39,700
Add your courses
Open Courses, click add and type the course name

6
00:00:43,267 --> 00:00:49,200
Add the rest the same way
College courses, or any course outside college

7
00:00:49,300 --> 00:00:54,200
Your weekly timetable
Lectures, sections, labs and your own study sessions

8
00:00:54,300 --> 00:00:59,233
Tasks and deadlines
Each task has a course, a day to do it and a deadline

9
00:00:59,333 --> 00:01:07,500
You get reminded before the deadline
1 day, 12 hours and 1 hour before, on your phone and laptop

10
00:01:07,600 --> 00:01:15,300
College tasks arrive on their own
Every assignment posted on your class channel is added for your level and program

11
00:01:15,367 --> 00:01:21,000
These came from the class channel
With deadline, course and a link to the post · data from HNU Board by Moustafa Sayed

12
00:01:21,100 --> 00:01:25,667
The AI assistant
The first time, it asks for a free API key. That takes two minutes

13
00:01:25,767 --> 00:01:29,867
Get a free key from Groq
Open console.groq.com/keys → Create API Key → copy the key starting with gsk_

14
00:01:29,967 --> 00:01:38,467
Paste it here and click Save and test
The site checks it works and stores it encrypted. Nobody can see it

15
00:01:39,400 --> 00:01:46,267
Write like you text a friend
It adds the tasks and slots and links them to the right course

16
00:01:51,467 --> 00:01:59,400
Done, all added
Two tasks with deadlines, and the lab in your timetable

17
00:01:59,467 --> 00:02:07,967
Focus timer
Open a task and press start. Your study time is saved on its own

18
00:02:10,500 --> 00:02:16,967
Bring your Obsidian notes
Upload your notes folder or a ZIP of it in Settings

19
00:02:17,067 --> 00:02:21,100
The library
Folders open and close like in Obsidian

20
00:02:21,200 --> 00:02:27,833
Notes look clean
Math, code, callouts, tables and diagrams all render

21
00:02:27,933 --> 00:02:36,433
Weekly review
Hours studied, time per course, finished tasks and your streak

22
00:02:36,667 --> 00:02:40,433
Reminders in your own voice
Record a clip for each stage and it plays with the reminder

23
00:02:40,533 --> 00:02:44,633
Use Claude with it
Create a connector here, then ask Claude about your tasks and notes

24
00:02:44,733 --> 00:02:51,900
Arabic or English
On your phone: open the link and choose Add to Home screen

25
00:02:57,767 --> 00:03:07,100
Get a free key for the assistant from Groq: open console.groq.com/keys, sign in with Google, click Create API Key, copy the key that starts with gsk_ and paste it in Settings → AI assistant.

26
00:03:07,767 --> 00:03:14,100
Happy studying! Website: study-joox-friends.loophole.site · Code: github.com/yousefJooX/studyhub
